I have the beginnings of a set of helper functions for this, since I
use it for the global temperature modelling, and it is needed for most
non-trivial spatial models.  The plan (ETA: the coming weeks) is to
adapt them to more general situations and add to the inla package;
this will be an extremely common situation, so at a minimum, the
helpers will be useful for transforming the input automatically to the
needed structure.  In theory, a general solution would entail parsing
and combining multiple sub-formulas, but that requires some R formula-
voodoo, that we're not sure how to perform yet.

/Finn

