return.marginals belongs in the 'control.compute' statement;
see ?control.compute

model.t <-
inla(ret~f(time,model="ar1",param=c(1,0.001,0,0.4),initial=c(2,3)),

family="stochvol_t",data=poundd,control.compute=list(dic=T,mlik=T,return.marginals=F),
control.inla=list(int.strategy="grid"),verbose=T)

runs fine.

make sure you run the test-version...

